"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025, August to September came in at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December at 46%. Grid 21158 had its driest year in 1953, at 50% of normal.</p>"}
